5. DATA PRIVACY & LOCAL DATABASE STORAGE
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Software operates using an embedded local SQLite database (database.db)
with Write-Ahead Logging (WAL) and client-side web storage.

  (a) LOCAL-FIRST PRIVACY: The Software does not transmit financial telemetry,
      user passwords, or company records to external third-party servers.
  (b) BACKUP RESPONSIBILITY: The licensee assumes all responsibility for
      regular database backups, encryption at rest, secure hosting, and
      access control within their administrative environment.

